{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-opencode-go-pool#card-zh","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-opencode-go-pool","commit":"ac00efe8d02ebb6ded8a1d7c5ba488bdcfcdcda5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode Go 多订阅池（DSH 插件，客户端类型未在代码中声明）：它接入 DSH 的模型请求流，为指定 provider 路由维护多个订阅凭据，并通过凭据存储写入当前使用的引用。插件会查询 OpenCode Go 用量接口，比较滚动、周和月额度，优先选择额度较健康的订阅；遇到额度限制且尚未输出内容时，可冷却失败凭据、切换订阅并重发请求。适合需要在一条 OpenCode Go 路由后管理多个订阅、减少手动切换的 DSH 用户。使用前需要在 profile patch 配置 route、activeRef、keys，并将路由 apiKeyEnv 指向 activeRef。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:450","index.js:183","index.js:427","cordis.patch.yml:9"]}
{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-opencode-go-pool#card-en","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-opencode-go-pool","commit":"ac00efe8d02ebb6ded8a1d7c5ba488bdcfcdcda5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"OpenCode Go Subscription Pool (DSH plugin): it selects credentials for one provider route by quota health, checking rolling, weekly, and monthly usage. Before output, a quota refusal can cool the failed key, switch subscriptions, and retry. Configure references in the profile patch.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:450","index.js:183","index.js:427","cordis.patch.yml:9"]}
